  "description": "A PDF of a Rask page or component, as the calling user sees it: await Pdf.From(Routes.Report(id)). Rendered on the server like a first GET, [Authorize] first; drawn by a pinned Chrome for Testing headless shell that the build fetches (checksum verified) and the container image carries — never downloaded at run time. Real fonts and every script, table headings repeated on every page, a footer and page numbers. Zero NuGet dependencies: Rask drives the browser over its own DevTools pipe.",
